#. Description of the plugin
#: gatecha-captcha.php
msgid "Self-hosted ALTCHA proof-of-work CAPTCHA via GateCHA. Protects WordPress forms without cookies, fingerprinting, or third-party services."
msgstr "CAPTCHA ALTCHA à preuve de travail, auto-hébergé via GateCHA. Protège les formulaires WordPress sans cookies, sans empreinte numérique ni service tiers."

